# Wallpaper gallery product

Appearance wallpaper **row**: pick / browse / crop / frost / pixelate only. No source list, JSON URLs, or Bing switch on Appearance.

**Browse** opens the gallery window (categories + search above, grid below). Favorite; click → confirm set wallpaper → Yes → crop. All source add / edit / delete stays in that window.

Built-ins: Bing Daily + Wallhaven SFW (`purity=100`). User sources: named HTTPS JSON catalogs. Tabs = sources + 收藏. No Unsplash/Pexels/Pixabay keys, Timeline, or R18. Tokens / `ui-primitives` only; no `marketplace.css` hex.

